    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"interaction_title\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Interaction analysis: spatial attention × network density\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Two key interactions tested with existing predictions:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**SA × N** (at MR=0.0): spatial-attention gain = MAE(Blind) − MAE(Dense)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"regressed against neighbour count N(R), distance-weighted availability\\n\",\n",
    "    \"W_i = Σ exp(−d/λ), and nearest-station distance d_NN.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**MR × N** (v27 only): ΔMAE = MAE(MR=0.5) − MAE(MR=0.0) regressed\\n\",\n",
    "    \"against W_i and d_NN as robustness checks alongside NN count.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The distance-weighted W_i (λ=25 km) captures spatial information\\n\",\n",
    "    \"availability more continuously than discrete counts — two stations\\n\",\n",
    "    \"with the same N(100) but different neighbour distances contribute\\n\",\n",
    "    \"differently to W_i.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"sa_gain_compute\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-09-02T10:37:07.336018Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-09-02T10:37:07.310625Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ── Spatial-attention gain per station at MR=0.0 ─────────────────────────────\\n\",\n",
    "    \"a_blind = AGG[\\\"v32-blind\\\"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"a_dense = AGG[\\\"v27\\\"]  # v27 = dense spatial attention\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"cnt_b = a_blind[\\\"mod_all_cnt\\\"][REF_KI]   # (N, NV)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"cnt_d = a_dense[\\\"mod_all_cnt\\\"][REF_KI]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"mae_blind = np.where(cnt_b > 0, a_blind[\\\"mod_all_sum_phys\\\"][REF_KI] /\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                     np.maximum(cnt_b, 1), np.nan)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"mae_dense = np.where(cnt_d > 0, a_dense[\\\"mod_all_sum_phys\\\"][REF_KI] /\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                     np.maximum(cnt_d, 1), np.nan)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"sa_gain = mae_blind - mae_dense  # (N, NV) — positive = SA helps\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for vi, v in enumerate(VARS):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    g = sa_gain[:, vi]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    valid = np.isfinite(g)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"{v}: median SA gain = {np.nanmedian(g):.4f}, \\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"          f\\\"mean = {np.nanmean(g):.4f}, \\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"          f\\\"positive: {(g[valid] > 0).sum()}/{valid.sum()}\\\")\\n\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"sa_interaction_plot\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-09-02T10:37:09.038748Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-09-02T10:37:07.337009Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ── SA gain vs N(R), W_i, d_NN — scatter with regression ────────────────────\\n\",\n",
    "    \"predictors = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    (\\\"N(10 km)\\\", NN_COMP[10]),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    (\\\"N(25 km)\\\", NN_COMP[25]),\\n\",\n",
