    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### MAE by exact neighbour count at R=10 km (0, 1, 3, 5 neighbours)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Complementary to the isolation bins above (which use the radius needed\\n\",\n",
    "    \"to reach 2 neighbours): fix the radius at 10 km and ask whether MAE\\n\",\n",
    "    \"degrades smoothly as the exact neighbour count steps up. Groups: 0, 1,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3, and 5 neighbours exactly, plus all other counts pooled as \\\"other\\\".\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
